<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-θύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacrifice,</i><i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				572
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				371
			</span></i>(lyr.); <i>destroy utterly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				191
			</span></i> (lyr.):—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθυσεῦνται</span> (
				Dor.
			fut.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἱερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1106.65
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>atone for, expiate by offerings,</i> c.acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.91
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀναγκαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			 (leg.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλ-</span>) : c. acc. pers.,
				<i>propitiate, appease,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ μακάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					912.12
				</span></i>
			 (anap.) : abs., <i>make atonement,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span> (thing or person) <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.9.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				41.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς θεοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.2.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>avert by sacrifices,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ εἱμαρμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>break out as heat</i> or <i>humours,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Liqu.</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
